<%= @brand.name %> now works with Claude

Hi <%= @user.first_name.presence || 'there' %>,

AI Apps is now turned on for <%= @company.name %>. Your team can add <%= @brand.name %> to Claude and ask it about leads, deals, inventory, service, the books, budgets, install projects and commission plans, using the same information they already see in <%= @brand.name %>.

STEP 1. CHOOSE WHO CAN USE IT (ADMINS)
You are an admin, so you already have access. For anyone else, open Settings, Users, Roles & Permissions in <%= @brand.name %> and give their role the AI Connector permission: Read to connect, Update to let Claude make changes for them.
<%= @roles_url %>

STEP 2. ADD THE <%= @brand.name.upcase %> PLUGIN IN CLAUDE
The plugin brings both pieces at once: the connection to <%= @brand.name %> and six ready-made skills. You need a Claude Pro, Max, Team or Enterprise plan.
- Open Claude at https://claude.ai or in the Claude desktop app.
- Select Customize (in the sidebar), then Plugins.
- Select Discover, search for <%= @brand.name %>, open it and select Add.
<% if @directory_url %>- Or go straight to the listing: <%= @directory_url %>
<% end %>
STEP 3. CONNECT YOUR <%= @brand.name.upcase %> ACCOUNT
- Still on the plugin's page, open its Connectors tab.
- Next to <%= @brand.name %>, select Add if it says Not added, then Connect.
- Sign in with your <%= @brand.name %> email and password. To let Claude make changes (add notes, tasks, drafts), tick "Also let it make changes" on that screen, then approve.
- The connector now shows Connected. It also appears under Customize, Connectors.
On a Claude Team or Enterprise plan, your Claude organization Owner may need to add the <%= @brand.name %> connector for the team first (they select "Connect for your team"). Each person then connects with their own <%= @brand.name %> login.

STEP 4. USE IT IN A CHAT
- Start a new chat. Select + in the message box, then Connectors, and make sure <%= @brand.name %> is switched on.
- Ask in plain words. The first time Claude uses a <%= @brand.name %> tool it may ask permission; choose Allow once or Always allow.
- To pick a skill yourself, type / in the message box and choose one of the <%= @brand.name %> skills.

EVERYDAY QUESTIONS
- "Show my open deals by stage."
- "Find Maria Lopez and tell me where her deal stands."
- "What three bedroom homes do we have in stock under $90,000?"
- "What tasks are due for me this week?"
- "Which service tickets are still open?"
- "Add a note to the Garcia lead: called, wants a tour Saturday."
- "Create a task for me to call John Lopez tomorrow at 10."

BIGGER JOBS (THESE USE THE BUILT IN SKILLS)
- "Which of my leads are going cold, and what should we do about them?"
- "My bank feed is behind. Help me get it caught up."
- "How are my install projects going this week? Draft the customer updates."
- "I want to rethink how my salespeople get paid. Walk me through it."
- "Help me rough out a budget for next year."
- "Help me close last month."

GOOD TO KNOW
- Claude sees only what each person can see in <%= @brand.name %>, at their locations.
- It asks before every change, and every change is recorded. Review and undo them under Settings, Integrations, AI Apps: <%= @ai_apps_url %>
- It never messages your customers, activates campaigns, workflows, budgets or commission plans, pays bills or deletes records. Those stay in <%= @brand.name %>.
- Dealer cost and gross stay hidden from Claude unless you turn on "Let AI apps see dealer cost and gross" on the same AI Apps page.

More detail: <%= @docs_url %>
Questions? Write to <%= @brand.support_email %>.
